  - neural inertia
  - perturbational complexity index
abstract: >-
  A hypothesis and theory paper, with a reference simulator, proposing that
  anaesthetic-induced unconsciousness occurs when the timing-coherent subgraph
  of the thalamocortical network falls below a percolation threshold,
  preventing distributed neural populations from reaching quorum on a shared
  state.
